WEBVTT

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.640
I know I wrote that down somewhere.

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:05.120
Was it in my notes? My to-do list?

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.200
Or did we say it in the meeting?

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.400
This is Pluto.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.160
My notes, my tasks,
and the notes Pluto took on the call.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.160
No bot. Right on my Mac.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.720
In the meeting, I promised Maya a draft.

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.720
One click and it’s on my list.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:21.680
When did I say I’d send it?
I’ll ask Pluto.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:24.400
Friday. And here’s the moment I said it.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:29.400
Pluto. Your notes, tasks, and meetings
in one place on your Mac.
